				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:slxmn2ejggkwwbzlej2axmx6/bafkreicizuiyr3nvt254ufexepmsoerc5gfcpdjg4b43l4hueantbveslm"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-09T14:57:44.000Z",
			"content": "Cool! If the background image is always the same, you can also speed up image generations a loooot by not spinning up a whole browser, but justing using canvaskit-wasm in Node/Deno/Bun, e.g. via <a href=\"https://github.com/mastrojs/og-image/\">github.com/mastrojs/og-...</a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 2030699,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mv3sh6mty22z",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-09T14:59:48.000Z",
			"content": "- now it’s 1 page for 474 unique images (cached in the screenshot service, not generated every time or every build)<br>\n- previously it was 474 pages for 474 unique images (also cached in the screenshot service, not generated every time or every build)<br>\n<br>\n(I removed 473 pages from my build)",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
