			},
			"date": "2026-09-09T15:40:45.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Ooh, clever! I should see if this helps get my build times down a little… thank you for sharing!</p>",
