		{
			"id": 2030748,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/hejchristian.com/post/3mv47vo5cwk2m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Christian Alder",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/hejchristian.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:u245ppickxm7kcu4s2cam5qm/bafkreibfblj7zohxpdzx4qnlvsbpiopuazopq3lh3rzh4li4cwfnmw7msa"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-09T19:00:33.000Z",
			"content": "Ohhh that&apos;s clever! Took me a trip to your repo to understand,  but it&apos;s all clicked for me now ???? Adding the json to the page is the same way I do a &quot;go to random page&quot; feature - great idea! And nice way to keep it secure so folks can&apos;t just generate any OG image with URL param shenanigans.",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 2030749,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com/post/3mv4ad5c22c26",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-09T19:08:05.000Z",
			"content": "you’re very welcome (and thank you for the kind words!)",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 2033885,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@chriskirknielsen/117305126771264302",
			"author": {
				"name": "Christopher Kirk-Nielsen",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@chriskirknielsen",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/cdn.masto.host/8f55a42f11a1fc29e6d494c4639293c79b11f2b9887a82668f8f5d14d27844d7.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2026-09-20T19:56:25.000Z",
			"content": "<p>I updated how I generate my OG images to a single page (<a href=\"https://github.com/chriskirknielsen/dotcom-2024/blob/main/src/content/og.vto\"><span>https://</span><span>github.com/chriskirknielsen/do</span><span>tcom-2024/blob/main/src/content/og.vto</span></a>), thanks to <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span>'s single-page idea (<a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/open-graph-easy-build/\"><span>https://www.</span><span>zachleat.com/web/open-graph-ea</span><span>sy-build/</span></a>). I end up with 121 fewer files, nice. And the build times?</p><p>Before: 1x OG page per page<br />➡️ Local cold start (3x avg): 4.613s average<br />➡️ Netlify build: 31s</p><p>After: 1x OG page for all pages<br />➡️ Local cold start (3x avg): 4.637s average<br />➡️ Netlify build: 31s</p><p>~~Eleventy~~ BuildAwesome is just too freakin' fast to make any difference. 💀</p>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/open-graph-easy-build/\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/chriskirknielsen/dotcom-2024/blob/main/src/content/og.vto\">dotcom-2024/src/content/og.vto at main · chriskirknielsen/dotcom-2024</a>",
			"type": "mention",
			"via": "webmention"
		}
	],
